  "title": "Oatmeal Chocolate Goodness Bars",
  "description": "This is a fabulous, quick recipe that has it all: oatmeal cookie and gooey chocolate covering. No one will say, &#39;None for me, thanks.&#39;",
  "authors": [
    "Chaya Radin"
  ],
